{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2022-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1663891200, "end_date": 1664582399, "month_true_total": 50, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:21:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "123104246", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962208728", "personaname": "Durabol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197962208728/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 125, "playtime_forever": 28, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 28, "last_played": 1578111666, "avatar": "6c0640f13870942bac7bf72a2acc3196ad42490e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am a 52 year old father, probably one of the oldest people playing. I am a single father to my son, who is now 14. My son recently started playing and in less than a week, he had already played for over 20 hours. This was terrible for me because it was already hard enough for me to spend time with my son, as he is always out with his friends or just watching videos on Youtube. So I decided to make a Steam account and get this game to see if I could maybe play alongside him. I loaded into the game and started playing but I was stuck on what you where supposed to do. I asked my son for help, and together we spent hours playing . I loved it as it was the best time I had spent with my son since my wife had died. Steam has ever since brought me and my son closer again, and now we actually spend time together outside the house as well. reminded me that there's fun to be had in everything, and it has brought both my son and I many happy memories.\n", "timestamp_created": 1664577571, "timestamp_updated": 1664577571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.431370824575424194", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_dat